  head: {text: 'Cold attach: dbg_wakeup_o works with the oscillator stopped'},
  foot: {text: ['tspan',
    'The escape detector is oversampled on clk_i, so with the oscillator gated a probe would be invisible. dbg_wakeup_o is a flop in the PROBE-CLOCK',
